20:12.120 --> 20:12.880
hostile place.

20:13.020 --> 20:13.260
Right.

20:13.660 --> 20:14.520
Things are constantly

20:14.520 --> 20:15.460
colliding with the

20:15.460 --> 20:16.700
system, forcing it

20:16.700 --> 20:17.760
