20:44.120 --> 20:44.720
maintain the

20:44.720 --> 20:45.660
metabolic viability

20:45.660 --> 20:46.400
of its energy

20:46.400 --> 20:47.660
consumption, and it

20:47.660 --> 20:48.640
has to uphold its

20:48.640 --> 20:49.460
macroscopic

20:49.460 --> 20:50.720
anatomical structure

20:50.720 --> 20:51.920
