20:56.220 --> 20:57.120
You need a way to

20:57.120 --> 20:58.020
combine all these

20:58.020 --> 20:59.020
distinct survival

20:59.020 --> 21:00.300
checks into one

21:00.300 --> 21:00.680
metric.

21:00.680 --> 21:01.440
Precisely.

21:02.080 --> 21:02.560
And to manage

21:02.560 --> 21:03.180
