21:08.340 --> 21:09.100
The aggregation

21:09.100 --> 21:09.500
operator.

21:09.700 --> 21:09.920
Right.

21:10.040 --> 21:10.940
It is a functional

21:10.940 --> 21:12.240
that takes all the

21:12.240 --> 21:13.120
