21:34.340 --> 21:34.520
Right.

21:34.580 --> 21:35.100
All the critical

21:35.100 --> 21:35.600
systems.

21:35.740 --> 21:36.440
And it essentially

21:36.440 --> 21:37.360
spits out a single

21:37.360 --> 21:38.300
Boolean value.

21:39.300 --> 21:40.460
Are we currently in a

21:40.460 --> 21:41.400
viable state of flight,

21:41.720 --> 21:42.360
