It is a viable path

22:01.180 --> 22:01.620
forward.

22:01.960 --> 22:02.920
But if it drops below?

22:03.220 --> 22:04.480
If a transition causes

22:04.480 --> 22:05.560
the aggregate score to

22:05.560 --> 22:07.180
