22:11.380 --> 22:12.500
Which sets up the core

22:12.500 --> 22:13.660
rule of survival in the

22:13.660 --> 22:14.860
paper, which they call

22:14.860 --> 22:15.840
the extension principle.

22:16.240 --> 22:16.640
Yes.

