The extension principle is

22:18.680 --> 22:20.000
beautifully simple, but

22:20.000 --> 22:20.900
it carries massive

22:20.900 --> 22:21.460
implications.

22:21.460 --> 22:23.240
It states that a

22:23.240 --> 22:24.480
persistent system is

22:24.480 --> 22:25.400
one where every

22:25.400 --> 22:26.440
