27:00.860 --> 27:01.820
the trauma occurred.

27:02.000 --> 27:02.960
And this was a massive

27:02.960 --> 27:04.100
paradigm shift for me,

27:04.100 --> 27:05.180
because we were so

27:05.180 --> 27:06.420
culturally conditioned by

27:06.420 --> 27:08.600
technology to view repair as

27:08.600 --> 27:10.380
a choral Z function, the

27:10.380 --> 27:11.700
undo button on a keyboard.

27:11.920 --> 27:13.520
We make a mistake, and we

27:13.520 --> 27:14.580
just want to go backward in

27:14.580 --> 27:15.900
time to the pristine, perfect

27:15.900 --> 27:17.040
state right before the

27:17.040 --> 27:17.720
mistake happened.

27:17.860 --> 27:19.040
It's a very human desire.

27:19.380 --> 27:20.320
But in complex

27:20.320 --> 27:22.320
thermodynamic systems, undo is

27:22.320 --> 27:23.280
physically and mathematically

27:23.280 --> 27:23.920
impossible.

27:24.440 --> 27:26.020
The arrow of time only moves

27:26.020 --> 27:26.400
forward.

27:26.580 --> 27:27.820
You can't unbreak the glass.

27:28.080 --> 27:28.480
No.

27:28.920 --> 27:30.500
Look at the biological and

27:30.500 --> 27:31.940
technological examples

27:31.940 --> 27:32.940
Flyxion maps out.

